{"seq":4,"slug":"settlement","title":"跨境资金结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/cross-border-payments/settlement","wordCount":1529,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨境资金结算\">跨境资金结算</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨境电商的资金结算是将消费者支付的资金通过清算网络最终转移到商户账户的过程。结算涉及多个中间环节——收单机构、卡组织/支付网络、代理行、商户银行——每个环节都有时间延迟和费用。优化结算效率和降低结算成本是跨境支付运营的核心目标。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[消费者支付] --&gt; B[收单机构]&#10;    B --&gt; C[清算网络]&#10;    C --&gt; D{结算方式}&#10;    D --&gt; E1[本地结算]&#10;    D --&gt; E2[跨境汇款]&#10;    D --&gt; E3[多币种账户]&#10;    E1 --&gt; F[商户本地账户]&#10;    E2 --&gt; G[商户母国账户]&#10;    E3 --&gt; H[虚拟多币种账户]&#10;    F --&gt; I[资金可用]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph LR\n    A[消费者支付] --&gt; B[收单机构]\n    B --&gt; C[清算网络]\n    C --&gt; D{结算方式}\n    D --&gt; E1[本地结算]\n    D --&gt; E2[跨境汇款]\n    D --&gt; E3[多币种账户]\n    E1 --&gt; F[商户本地账户]\n    E2 --&gt; G[商户母国账户]\n    E3 --&gt; H[虚拟多币种账户]\n    F --&gt; I[资金可用]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结算模式</th>\n<th>结算周期</th>\n<th>费用</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本地结算</td>\n<td>T+1 到 T+3</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>有本地实体的商户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境电汇</td>\n<td>T+3 到 T+7</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>50/笔</td>\n<td>小额低频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付网关结算</td>\n<td>T+2 到 T+5</td>\n<td>0.5-2%</td>\n<td>中小跨境商户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟IBAN</td>\n<td>T+1 到 T+3</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>多市场运营</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"清算与结算流程\">清算与结算流程</h2><p>清算（Clearing）是计算各参与方之间应收应付金额的过程，结算（Settlement）是实际的资金转移。两者是不同的步骤——清算通常在交易当天完成，结算可能延迟 1-5 个工作日。</p>\n<p>卡支付的清算由卡组织（Visa/Mastercard）通过其全球清算网络完成。每天营业结束后，卡组织汇总当日所有交易，计算各发卡行和收单行之间的净额头寸（Netting），然后通过银行间清算系统（如 Fedwire、TARGET2）完成资金转移。净额清算大幅减少了需要实际转移的资金量——如果 A 银行欠 B 银行 100 万而 B 银行欠 A 银行 80 万，只需转移 20 万净额。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SettlementBatch {&#10;  batchId: string;&#10;  merchantId: string;&#10;  settlementDate: string;&#10;  currency: string;&#10;  transactions: {&#10;    transactionId: string;&#10;    type: &#39;sale&#39; | &#39;refund&#39; | &#39;chargeback&#39;;&#10;    grossAmount: number;&#10;    fees: {&#10;      interchange: number;&#10;      schemeFee: number;&#10;      acquirerFee: number;&#10;      gatewayFee: number;&#10;    };&#10;    netAmount: number;&#10;  }[];&#10;  summary: {&#10;    totalGross: number;&#10;    totalFees: number;&#10;    totalRefunds: number;&#10;    totalChargebacks: number;&#10;    netSettlement: number;&#10;    reserveHeld: number;&#10;    netPayout: number;&#10;  };&#10;  bankTransfer: {&#10;    beneficiaryAccount: string;&#10;    bankCode: string;&#10;    reference: string;&#10;    estimatedArrival: string;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SettlementBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  batchId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  merchantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  settlementDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  transactions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    transactionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sale'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'refund'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'chargeback'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    grossAmount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fees</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      interchange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      schemeFee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      acquirerFee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      gatewayFee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    netAmount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  summary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    totalGross</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    totalFees</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    totalRefunds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    totalChargebacks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    netSettlement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reserveHeld</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    netPayout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bankTransfer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    beneficiaryAccount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bankCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    estimatedArrival</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>结算延迟的主要来源：批处理周期（T+0 到 T+1 清算）、风控冻结（新商户通常有 7-14 天的滚动储备金）、跨境汇款路由（代理行中转增加 1-3 天）、节假日和时区差异。对于高频交易商户，每天结算；低频商户可能每周结算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结算环节</th>\n<th>延迟来源</th>\n<th>典型耗时</th>\n<th>优化方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批处理</td>\n<td>卡组织清算周期</td>\n<td>T+1</td>\n<td>无法缩短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风控冻结</td>\n<td>储备金/审核</td>\n<td>0-14天</td>\n<td>提升信用等级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境汇款</td>\n<td>代理行中转</td>\n<td>1-5天</td>\n<td>SWIFT gpi/本地结算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入账处理</td>\n<td>收款行处理</td>\n<td>0-1天</td>\n<td>选择快速入账银行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多币种资金管理\">多币种资金管理</h2><p>跨境电商在多个市场收款时，需要管理多种货币的资金账户。传统方式是在每个市场开设本地银行账户，但成本高、管理复杂。现代解决方案是通过支付服务商的虚拟多币种账户（Multi-Currency Account）或虚拟 IBAN 实现集中管理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MultiCurrencyAccount {&#10;  accountId: string;&#10;  balances: {&#10;    currency: string;&#10;    available: number;&#10;    pending: number;&#10;    reserved: number;&#10;    total: number;&#10;  }[];&#10;  operations: {&#10;    receive: {&#10;      localIBAN: Record&lt;string, string&gt;;&#10;      swiftCode: string;&#10;      supportedMethods: (&#39;wire&#39; | &#39;ach&#39; | &#39;sepa&#39; | &#39;local_transfer&#39;)[];&#10;    };&#10;    convert: {&#10;      supportedPairs: string[];&#10;      rateType: &#39;market&#39; | &#39;fixed&#39;;&#10;      markup: number;&#10;      minAmount: number;&#10;    };&#10;    withdraw: {&#10;      methods: (&#39;wire&#39; | &#39;ach&#39; | &#39;sepa&#39;)[];&#10;      currencies: string[];&#10;      fees: Record&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;      schedule: &#39;instant&#39; | &#39;daily&#39; | &#39;weekly&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MultiCurrencyAccount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  accountId<