\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>资金归集策略决定了多币种余额的处理方式。主要有三种策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归集策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>即时归集</td>\n<td>收款后立即兑换为母币</td>\n<td>现金流可预测</td>\n<td>频繁兑换费用高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量归集</td>\n<td>定期（每周/月）批量兑换</td>\n<td>可获批发汇率</td>\n<td>承担汇率风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按需归集</td>\n<td>保留多币种余额，需要时兑换</td>\n<td>灵活应对汇率</td>\n<td>管理复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然对冲</td>\n<td>用本币余额支付本地费用</td>\n<td>减少兑换需求</td>\n<td>需要本地支出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"对账与资金核对\">对账与资金核对</h2><p>支付对账（Reconciliation）是核对支付网关/收单行的交易记录与商户系统订单记录的过程。跨境场景的对账复杂度更高——涉及多币种、多通道、汇率差异和跨时区的交易。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ReconciliationJob {&#10;  jobId: string;&#10;  period: { start: string; end: string };&#10;  sources: {&#10;    internal: { source: &#39;order_system&#39;; recordCount: number };&#10;    external: { source: string; recordCount: number }[];&#10;  };&#10;  matching: {&#10;    strategy: &#39;exact&#39; | &#39;fuzzy&#39; | &#39;rule_based&#39;;&#10;    matchKeys: (&#39;transactionId&#39; | &#39;orderId&#39; | &#39;amount&#39; | &#39;date&#39;)[];&#10;    tolerances: {&#10;      amountTolerance: number;&#10;      dateTolerance: number;&#10;      fxTolerance: number;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  results: {&#10;    matched: number;&#10;    unmatched: {&#10;      internalOnly: { count: number; totalAmount: number };&#10;      externalOnly: { count: number; totalAmount: number };&#10;      amountMismatch: { count: number; totalDifference: number };&#10;    };&#10;    matchRate: number;&#10;  };&#10;  actions: {&#10;    autoResolved: number;&#10;    manualReview: number;&#10;    escalated: number;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"colo